# cmakelint configuration for hipObject
# https://github.com/cmake-lint/cmake-lint
#
# Line length is impractical for CMake generator expressions and
# version strings.
#
# wonkycase is disabled because CMake's own FetchContent module
# commands (FetchContent_Declare, FetchContent_MakeAvailable, etc.)
# are mixed-case, and that naming is mandated upstream, not ours.
filter=-linelength,-readability/wonkycase
